<title>USA: Morton Intl Inc Q3 March 31 net rises.</title>
<headline>Morton Intl Inc Q3 March 31 net rises.</headline>
<dateline>CHICAGO 1997-04-15</dateline>
<text>
<p>1997			1996</p>
<p> Shr			 $ 0.76		    $0.72</p>
<p> Net			109,300		  107,700</p>
<p> Revs		   1,027,000		  998,400</p>
<p>	 (All Data Above 000s Except Per Share Numbers)</p>
<p>NOTE: Year-earlier Q3 included one-time receipt of $9.4 million (after tax) from its joint venture partner, Nippon Paint Co, for the creation of Morton Nippon Coatings. Excluding the impact of the joint venture, earnings rose 15 percent.  </p>
<p>			9 MONTHS</p>
<p> Shr			  $1.91		    $1.83</p>
<p> Net			276,100		  274,500</p>
<p> Revs		   2,846,200		2,724,100</p>
<p> Avg shrs		 144,496		  150,232</p>
<p>	 (All Data Above 000s Except Per Share Numbers)</p>
<p>NOTE: Year-ago nine-months included income of $24 million for environmental insurance settlements.</p>
<p>		((Reuters Chicago Newsdesk (312) 408-8787))</p>
</text>
